{
  "sleep control": "睡眠控場",
  "Every few basic attacks put an enemy to sleep with Drowse, and anything that wakes from her sleep is Haunted and weaker. Sleeping enemies lose their cooldowns, their armor and their healing; her ult wakes them into nightmares. The signature leaves the Hush of Callowmere after her ult, putting the whole field back to sleep.": "每隔幾次普攻，睏倦會使一名敵人入睡。從莉薩拉的睡眠中醒來的敵人會受到夢魘糾纏並變弱。沉睡的敵人損失冷卻、護甲和治療，終極技能會將他們喚入噩夢。招牌天賦會讓醒來的敵人再睡一次。",
  "link healer": "連結治療者",
  "Dreamthread pairs carry each other's damage, and the moon turns every {0} s between stronger heals and stronger shields. Cocoons that hold to the end hatch their ally into a faster, stronger fighter. Dreamthread and Moon Cocoon grow to cover more allies; the signature keeps a linked ally alive through a killing blow.": "由夢線連結的盟友分擔傷害。月亮每 {0} 秒在強化治療和強化護盾之間切換。撐到最後的繭會孵出更快、更強的盟友。夢線和月之繭能保護更多盟友。招牌天賦使連結的盟友免受致命一擊。",
  "caster punisher": "施法懲戒者",
  "Her dust settles on every enemy she hits and flares when they try to cast. She hunts the Lantern, the enemy with the most ability power, and her blinding dust turns misses into ultimate energy. Queen of Quiet Wings becomes a fuse; the signature flares every Dust on the field and drags the Lantern into the fire.": "鱗粉落在每個被擊中的敵人身上，並在他們施法時爆燃。她把技能強度最高的敵人當作燈籠追獵。致盲鱗粉將攻擊落空轉為終極技能能量。靜翼女王化作引信。招牌天賦點燃全場鱗粉，把燈籠拉入火中。"
